OL,3,AElton John, Oprah Winfrey and Paul
OL,4,AMcCartney join tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Paul McCartney, Oprah Winfrey,
OL,7,FTaylor Swift, Beyonce and Sir Elton
OL,8,FJohn have led a wave of tributes to
OL,9,Fmusic icon Dolly Parton, honouring her
OL,10,Fimpact across the globe.
OL,12,FThe Beatles legend called Parton a
OL,13,F"magnificent star", Oprah said she
OL,14,F"brought the light" and the Rocket Man
OL,15,Fsinger dubbed her a "giant of an
OL,16,Fartist" who was "irreplaceable".
OL,18,FParton died on Tuesday at the age of
OL,19,F80, after "a brief battle with cancer",
OL,20,Fher team said in a statement to CBS,
OL,21,Fthe BBC's US partner.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
