OL,3,AElton John, Oprah Winfrey and Paul
OL,4,AMcCartney join tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have poured in from US
OL,7,Fpresidents across the political
OL,8,Fspectrum and musicians across all
OL,9,Fgenres, remembering her not just for
OL,10,Fher award-winning career, but her
OL,11,Fphilanthropy and humble nature that
OL,12,Ftranscended country music.
